        <mxCell id="PzpG2bri5GxlcRA9Ap2d-173" parent="PzpG2bri5GxlcRA9Ap2d-172" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;This WithdrawRequest class is a DTO (Data Transfer Object) used to store and transfer withdrawal request data.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Contains two private fields:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;accountNumber&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;amount&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Provides:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Getter methods → to access values&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Setter methods → to update values&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Used to receive withdrawal details from API requests&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Helps transfer withdrawal data cleanly between the handler, service, and DAO layers of the ATM application&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
